			'Comparable names on the <a href="/sold/">sold page</a> give a realistic range. If you want an independent view of one name, an <a href="/domain-appraisal-services/">appraisal</a> sets out a value and the reasons for it.',
			array( 'h3' => 'What to include' ),
			'Name the domain, give your price and say how you would like to pay. A short note on how you plan to use the name helps the broker understand the offer, and a contact email you check often avoids delays.',
			'Give a single figure rather than a range. A range tells the broker you will pay the higher number, and it slows the reply while the broker asks you to confirm. If you would rather pay monthly, say so in the domain offer, so the broker can answer on the price and the plan together.',
			'The listed price already reflects comparable sales, so offers close to it are more likely to succeed than very low ones. Low offers are still read and answered.',
